e gonna put together our own testing  protocol and get it done  now some Democratic lawmakers are  criticizing the White House testing plan  senator patty Murray of Washington State  says it will accomplish  nothing new but there's no doubt that we  do need more testing a study out of  Harvard says that by June we should be  testing 5 million people a day and 20  million in July Tony all right Ben Tracy  for us at the White House Ben thank you  very much
 

